  "rules": {
    "registration": "OD calls OC5F_cg, which enumerates Bu with oldcodefn_Bg. That function creates the mapped combat body and registers h03L_Timer every 5 seconds for an A0XM carrier. Arena uses PassiveSkillNoArgJJC and has no h03L_Timer call. Arbitrary creation does not register this timer.",
    "gain": "killnum+1; timed gain alone also writes timenum+1. Mana+1 and life+100 occur before YDWE max-life +100 and attack +10. killnum caps current reserve, not lifetime gains: timenum is never read.",
    "kill": "Independent if inside the disabled main death trigger: killer A0XM >0, killnum<15, mana<15, then one GetRandomReal(1,101)<=20. Unit death is neither attack-only nor enemy-only. Web maps one U[0,1) draw to 1+100U; cutoff is .19 inclusive, not .20. The independent initial alchemy roll still occurs first.",
